# CR 723 and CR 514.3a. human casts Time Stop in Beginning of Combat with
# eight other cards in hand (seven after it leaves). EndTurn resolves: the
# turn skips to Cleanup, where human discards down to seven. The ai's
# Sangromancer ("whenever an opponent discards a card, you may gain 3 life")
# triggers off that discard, so the Cleanup grants priority and repeats
